      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Daily LinkedIn Job Scraping\n- **Trigger:** Runs automatically every morning at 8:00 AM.\n- **Data Ingestion:** Calls the Apify LinkedIn Jobs Scraper API for *Werkstudent* roles in Frankfurt posted in the last 24 hours (`r86400`), then retrieves the raw dataset items."
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        80,
        -144
      ],
      "id": "ea3f984f-83f1-48bc-8e58-862a1887a9dc",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Deterministic Deduplication & Batching\n- **State Tracking:** Filters out any job IDs already processed in previous runs so duplicate listings are never sent twice (zero LLM tokens wasted on deduplication).\n- **Batching & Guard:** Aggregates all newly discovered jobs into a single array and stops execution cleanly if 0 new jobs were found."
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        -144
      ],
      "id": "c22087f7-54ae-4e41-aed5-35e7364bcc59",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. AI Relevance Filtering & HTML Formatting\n- **Semantic Screening:** Evaluates new job descriptions against target skills and filters out irrelevant or non-student roles.\n- **Structured Output:** Generates a clean, mobile-friendly HTML digest with role summaries and direct application links."
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
